      "id": "GHSA-8vj2-vxx3-667w#1",
      "score": 0.75,
      "text": "GHSA-8vj2-vxx3-667w (pillow) details:\n`PIL.ImageMath.eval` in Pillow before 9.0.0 allows evaluation of arbitrary expressions, such as ones that use the Python exec method `ImageMath.eval(\"exec(exit())\")`.\n\nWhile Pillow 9.0.0 restricted top-level builtins available to PIL.ImageMath.eval(), it did not prevent builtins available to lambda expressions. These are now also restricted in 9.0.1.",
